<title>UK: Toronto Dominion sets C$100 million Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Toronto Dominion sets C$100 million Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Toronto Dominion Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TORONTO DOMINION BANK</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.12    PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.52     SPREAD	+36 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONTARIO   HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND CANADA SEP 2001 BOND</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
